{'symbol': 'BKR', 'date': '2023-01-03 08:00:00', 'title': "BAKER HUGHES TO SUPPLY KEY TECHNOLOGY FOR ONE OF THE WORLD'S LARGEST OFFSHORE CARBON CAPTURE & SEQUESTRATION FACILITIES", 'text': "HOUSTON AND LONDON, JAN. 03, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BAKER HUGHES (NASDAQ: BKR), AN ENERGY TECHNOLOGY COMPANY, ANNOUNCED TUESDAY IT HAS BEEN AWARDED A CONTRACT TO BE BOOKED IN THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2022 BY MALAYSIA MARINE AND HEAVY ENGINEERING (MMHE) TO SUPPLY CARBON DIOXIDE (CO2) COMPRESSION EQUIPMENT TO PETRONAS CARIGALI SDN. BHD.'S KASAWARI OFFSHORE CARBON CAPTURE AND SEQUESTRATION (CCS) PROJECT IN SARAWAK, MALAYSIA. THE PROJECT IS EXPECTED TO BE THE WORLD'S LARGEST OFFSHORE CCS FACILITY, WITH CAPACITY TO REDUCE CO2 EMISSIONS BY 3.3 MILLION TONS PER ANNUM (MTPA)."}